Subject: Preserve native container allocation ownership

Upstream-base: f75ccf1ad20e5bd7585962990db08067c0ae498a

Preserve native container allocation ownership
Add explicit destruction followed by owning-arena free for NewAdapter nodes
and inventory trees, keeping standard host new/delete unchanged. Matching
aligned placement deletes reclaim failed constructions. Select the native
compiler's stack-allocation spelling for the original AVL implementation.

